  abilityNotes: "IMPLEMENTED (HighPriestessAbility). On play, heals your Soul for
    1 + the number of rounds this copy sat in hand. A regular capped Heal, not an
    Over-Heal, since the GDD names Over-Heal as the only thing allowed past the Soul's
    cap (GDD 8). Cards in the opening hand count as having arrived on round 1 \u2014
    that's what makes the GDD's own example (held from turn 1, played turn 8, heals
    8) come out right."
